  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Halve the cucumber lengthwise and thinly slice. Finely chop the tomato. Pick the coriander leaves, discarding the stems. Combine 1 tsp red wine vinegar and a pinch of sugar in a bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the cucumber and tomato and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2917642/photos/large/121819_1-f8860ba04026e590f0a76771e8551c62.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make Tex-Mex sauce: Combine the Tex-Mex seasoning, half the tomato paste and 2 tbs water in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2917643/photos/large/121819_2-5997488c761ba9c88d4fc1a8466a1b87.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook patties: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over medium-high heat. Cook the plant-based patties for 4-5 mins each side until browned. Remove from the pan and cut into 1cm-thick strips. Add the Tex-Mex sauce to the pan and cook, stirring, over medium heat for 1 min or until slightly reduced. Add the sliced patties and stir until coated. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2917644/photos/large/121819_3-07beceee19bfdb6629d7948692770bea.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tortillas: While the patties are cooking, put the tortillas on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through (see Cooking tip).",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2917645/photos/large/121819_4-5791cacd4903afd843a6777b6714501a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Spread the tortillas with the vegan mayonnaise, then top with the Tex-Mex patties, tomato salsa and coriander leaves. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2917646/photos/large/121819_5-7b304e1236f924b080063dc74d519b0a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it spicy: Chilli lovers, go wild and top your tacos with thinly sliced fresh chilli, chilli flakes or your favourite chilli sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2917647/photos/large/121819_6-f013a19abf9030e84becdee58e930b32.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
